<div class="wp-block-wdl-paid-block-content-7 paid-block-content-7"><ul class="paid-block-content-7__inner"><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a class="link" href="/gyoseishoshi-contact/"><div class="image" style="border-radius:20px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_jidosha_1/scope_1.webp" alt=""><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:8px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">車庫証明の取得</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">保管場所の所在図と配置図を作り、警察署へ申請します。使用の本拠から直線2km以内という決まりの確認もこちらで行います。</p></a></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a class="link" href="/gyoseishoshi-contact/"><div class="image" style="border-radius:20px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_jidosha_1/scope_2.webp" alt=""><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:8px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">名義変更・住所変更</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">売買や譲渡の移転登録、引っ越しの変更登録を代行します。引っ越しから15日以内という期限があります。</p></a></li><li class="paid-block-content-7__li"><a class="link" href="/gyoseishoshi-contact/"><div class="image" style="border-radius:20px;border-color:var(--color-main);border-width:0;border-style:none"><img src="https://liteword-assets.bigi-ishikawa.workers.dev/t/gyoseishoshi/gyomu_jidosha_1/scope_3.webp" alt=""><h3 class="ttl font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:600;color:;border-radius:8px;border-bottom-color:var(--color-main);border-bottom-width:8px;border-bottom-style:solid">事業用車の増減車</h3></div><p class="paid-block-content-7__text font_size_m" data-lw_font_set="" style="font-weight:400;color:var(--color-black)">緑ナンバーの増車・減車に必要な連絡書の取得から登録まで。台数が多い場合もまとめてお引き受けします。</p></a></li></ul></div>
<!-- /wp:wdl/paid-block-content-7 -->

